<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Our Mission | Eporia</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/mission.css">
</head>
<body>

      <!-- Back Button -->
<div class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 m-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" onclick="history.back()">
      <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Back
    </button>
  </div>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Our Mission at Eporia</h1>
    <p>We’re building a private, anonymous, and text-first social space where people can express themselves without judgment or surveillance.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 1 -->
  <section class="mission-section text-center">
    <h2>🛡️ Privacy First</h2>
    <p>We believe that privacy is a human right. At Eporia, we don’t track users, harvest data, or expose your identity. We empower you to speak freely, without fear of profiling or monitoring.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2 -->
  <section class="mission-section text-center">
    <h2>💬 Raw and Real Expression</h2>
    <p>We’re a platform for conversation — not influencers. No filters, no fake metrics, no pressure to perform. Just text-based discussion that feels more human, less performative.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 3 -->
  <section class="mission-section text-center">
    <h2>🌐 Open and Accessible</h2>
    <p>Eporia is open to everyone. Whether you're here to learn, vent, joke, or connect — we’ve built a space where you don’t need likes or followers to be heard.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 4 -->
  <section class="mission-section text-center">
    <h2>🚀 Community-Driven Future</h2>
    <p>Our platform is shaped by our users. We’re building in the open, with feedback and contribution at the heart of every improvement. Eporia is yours, not some corporation's.</p>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
